        <body>
            <div xml:id="d497">

                <pb facs="0949" n="825" xml:id="pg825"/>

                <head>No. 493.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Navarro to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Mexico</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                            York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1881-02-10"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">February</hi> 10, 1881</date>. (Received
                        February 15.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary</hi>: I have the honor herewith to
                    inclose a copy of a note which the department of foreign relations has addressed
                    to me, instructing me to give notice to the Government of the United States (as
                    I hereby do) of its intention to terminate the convention of July 10, 1868,
                    concerning naturalization and citizenship, at the expiration of the twelve
                    months mentioned in article 5 of said convention.</p>
                <p>I avail myself, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JUAN N. NAVARRO.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d497-a1.xml" xpointer="d497-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
